  - m_Id: 20015441747968
    m_Localized: "How to Play\n\nObjective: Checkmate the King.\nArsenal: Capture
      pieces (except the King and Queen) to add them to your collection.\nMetamorphosis:
      You can transform into any piece from your arsenal at any time.\nDefeat: If
      your piece is captured, the level restarts.\n\nPiece Movement\nPawn: Move 1
      square forward; capture by moving 1 square diagonally.\nRook: Move in a straight
      line to the edge of the board or to the first target.\nBishop: Move diagonally
      to the edge of the board or to the first target.\nKnight: Move in an \u201CL\u201D
      shape in any direction.\n\nStars per level:\nFirst star: for winning (capturing
      the King).\nSecond star: for completing the level without hints.\nThird star:
      for reaching the required number of points (capturing enemies).\n\nTranslated
      with DeepL.com (free version)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20160120070144
    m_Localized: "Highlight the fields under attack with \u201CH\u201D (English)\n(-1
      star!)"
